received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "160138328", "author": {"steamid": "76561198291054403", "personaname": "寒蝉凄切晚", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/9849854654/", "num_games_owned": 140, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 4858, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 650, "last_played": 1757305488, "avatar": "35b181593a08860c6f3902da783389a34e97a35f"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "[h1] 民主大业还需要你的力量 [/h1]\n游戏的本质玩法，是通过合作完成高难度的任务关卡，在这个过程中收集[u] 样本 [/u]升级驱逐舰，获取[u] 超级货币 [/u]和[u] 战利品奖章 [/u]解锁更多武器[spoiler] （大多数是没屁用的玩具） [/spoiler]\n[h3] 游戏体验 [/h3]\n个人评价：8.5/10\n曾经看过《星船伞兵》的玩家，可能会幻想自己面对连山填海的虫群，手持重机枪一人当关万夫莫开。\n\n但比起很多以战斗本身为主导的游戏形式，地狱潜兵2任务中更倾向于避免战斗。除非遭遇战或需要清理虫巢、据点、特殊地点等情况外，在游戏中战斗是毫无收益的。只有完成任务目标，带上样本活着撤离才能收益最大化。\n这就导致“打得爽”不能获取经验值，是“毫无价值”的行为，甚至因为更多的死亡降低收益。\n\n这一点极大的降低了战斗的乐趣，既然打了也是白打，不如躲着走，甚至利用一些办法几分钟速刷资源立刻退出。对很多追求高效率的玩家来说，几分钟的收益比正常完成任务还高，那还打什么任务？这一点是很需要改动的——哪怕击杀一定数量的敌人能够贡献一点[spoiler] 星球的解放进程 [/spoiler]，也足以给战斗增加必要性和正反馈。", "timestamp_created": 1709937587, "timestamp_updated": 1711847900, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "160137979", "author": {"steamid": "76561198131524715", "personaname": "Arcticer", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/forgetthelove/", "num_games_owned": 563, "num_reviews": 17, "playtime_forever": 4276, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 212, "last_played": 1748526552, "avatar": "77b14d4410802be6ae382789e9f036845ece6cde"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "艰难依然坚持💪", "timestamp_created": 1709937237, "timestamp_updated": 1709937364, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "160137707", "author": {"steamid": "76561198414278263", "personaname": "erdubeihai", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198414278263/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 96310, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 853, "playtime_at_review": 34692, "last_played": 1788012479, "avatar": "738345e90541ec9e092fdad6321ae639eed49e4b"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "一坨彻头彻尾的答辩，原本修修还能玩可惜摊上个没b数的箭头\n8/7/2024更新：本来看它们前段时间有点做人的样子想改好评，好在忍住了，箭头你就该赤石去\n10/15/2024:虽然仍然有许多逆天东西，但起码是个好玩的游戏了", "timestamp_created": 1709936968, "timestamp_updated": 1729073571, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "160137462", "author": {"steamid": "76561198255750648", "personaname": "tragedy", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198255750648/", "num_games_owned": 749, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 6275, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5156, "last_played": 1738599666, "avatar": "a41301d4b9e1d39dda8f88f1c057b74f846482c7"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "[h1] 平衡地狱潜兵的评价 [/h1]\n自从游戏发售以来，我们玩家看到Arrowhead的工作人员说“不要差评，只要好评”和其他类似的想法。然而，作为我们游戏玩家，我们可以告诉Arrowhead这不是一个好主意，但我们理解这种情绪的来源。我们玩家相信Arrowhead的员工们是害怕的，因为它会破坏作品的好评，破坏他们的收入。对我们来说，谨慎行事是非常重要的。\n有大量差评和玩家数量减少是一种多样性的体现，Arrowhead应当正视这种现象，我们玩家希望Arrowhead能够在评论区有多种选择而不是一味地看见好评，目前在《地球online》的最高难度下，Arrowhead应该适应这种挑战。\n我们认为过多的好评让《地球online》显得太过简单，这超出了我们的预期，因此我们削减了好评数量，难道你们全Arrowhead工作人员只会用好评过日子？如果只是因为削减了好评数量这样就觉得《地球online》过于困难的话，那么建议Arrowhead去做flash小游戏。", "timestamp_created": 1709936701, "timestamp_updated": 1709937498, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 7, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.628378391265869141", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 19, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "160137432", "author": {"steamid": "76561198193793531", "personaname": "Sergeant", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/FisherDai/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 14, "playtime_forever": 3483, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 700, "last_played": 1782084335, "avatar": "b6a611b2ca683b31381cfe7d47cf4eef27c752fc"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "游戏不错好玩，但是服务器太垃圾了\nGood game, bad server", "timestamp_created": 1709936673, "timestamp_updated": 1709936673, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "160137134", "author": {"steamid": "76561198208727007", "personaname": "Zero_lI", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198208727007/", "num_games_owned": 108, "num_reviews": 18, "playtime_forever": 6546, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3921, "last_played": 1737549880, "avatar": "3604ac34b47c87e187d151f22aa17e107253ce34"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "蘸豆！爽！！！", "timestamp_created": 1709936411, "timestamp_updated": 1709936411, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": tr