view": "一共38分钟游戏时间 看了38分钟的叛国", "timestamp_created": 1709931456, "timestamp_updated": 1709931456, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.504132270812988281", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "160131876", "author": {"steamid": "76561198047029155", "personaname": "大灵峰相剑师", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198047029155/", "num_games_owned": 262, "num_reviews": 24, "playtime_forever": 4391, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1732, "last_played": 1748532787, "avatar": "ded793281a3f180151bd3b718b0e3d37de95c046"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "傲慢的制作组瞎j8更新还嘲讽玩家，虽然机甲很帅但我还是要给差评，tmd15分钟的任务更新以后撤离要4分钟，更新一坨大便", "timestamp_created": 1709931327, "timestamp_updated": 1709931327, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.504132270812988281", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "160131532", "author": {"steamid": "76561198088173689", "personaname": "Globus (GRY+BED+GEQ+Buff )", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198088173689/", "num_games_owned": 241, "num_reviews": 87, "playtime_forever": 9869, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1610, "last_played": 1718708733, "avatar": "a521352ec938d97a89f4b9655f75924d3cea6344"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "上周五买的，买完之后和朋友一起打，没有赶上发售那天传说中的服务器崩溃，反而和朋友觉得服务器不错，一个在欧洲一个在澳洲都没感觉到什么延迟。\n一小时之后，就开始卡bug，游戏疯狂崩溃。直接按网上说的什么删文件，验证完整性之后才好。\n然后愉快的玩了一个周末，虽然游戏内bug不少，但是起码不影响正常游玩。打虫子很有星河舰队的味道。\n然后昨天好像是有个大更新，更新完之后，今天进游戏就感觉比之前卡的多，进图开箱子捡个勋章都能给我卡在原地十秒。打着打着，晚上和朋友一起开黑之后，突然就卡在结算画面了，然后任务经验还没给结算。我们一起完成了一个大任务的两个分支，打完之后突然就变成了之完成一个任务。勋章购买界面也直接卡死，完全不能买东西。\n个人人物是清理6个支线，我都辛辛苦苦打了四个了，出来一看又变成了0/6.\n关掉游戏重新进入，就直接卡在载入界面无限读秒。\n这尼玛，反向更新是么？？？？是服务器被人偷走换成土豆了吗。\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n已经好几周没有新的战备和装备了，也没有什么特别好玩的任务，舰船的新升级也没几个需要升级的，属于又肝又没用的。现在哪怕是周末，玩家人数也不复从前，肉眼可见的减少。感觉💊。\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n2024.05.09\n索尼要求绑psn这是因为索尼没妈\n但是箭头你tm闲的没事就砍玩家装备加强敌人还不修bug，你是不想要妈了吗？", "timestamp_created": 1709931043, "timestamp_updated": 1715251038, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "160131209", "author": {"steamid": "76561198099336076", "personaname": "Yunlanger", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198099336076/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 43, "playtime_forever": 17043, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3512, "last_played": 1735660756, "avatar": "2366a36cb14692d10cb8cab2e6eab444c0005876"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "我的小队误杀了一个平民，扣了25块钱，结算界面5颗星，然后因为这25块钱把所有奖励都扣除了，我不知道这是不是显示bug，如果不是，WRNMNMSL", "timestamp_created": 1709930760, "timestamp_updated": 1709930760, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 2, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "160130953", "author": {"steamid": "76561198945954956", "personaname": "AIbert", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198945954956/", "num_games_owned": 26, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 3982, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1748, "last_played": 1741107872, "avatar": "95d8f1c00bbdc43e289e494f3dad027a6f930ac4"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "网络连接太差劲了", "timestamp_created": 1709930542, "timestamp_updated": 1709930542, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "160130934", "author": {"steamid": "76561198067331774", "personaname": "兔牙海民丶", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198067331774/", "num_games_owned": 276, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 23152, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 211, "playtime_at_review": 3780, "last_played": 1787234255, "avatar": "7cacf03124f1487bf1afeb2d12ddb9c5878c9dca"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "我买了游戏，肝的很厉害，但是你现在把我唯一能用的几个武器给削弱了。\r\n然后塔玛德服务器经常炸，经验也没了，钱也没了，老子快乐也没了，和朋友联机也玩不了，那你说说你这游戏这么早出来是找骂的吗？我真想痛骂一顿，看看DC上面那个策划回给玩家什么态度？\r\n天天给我整Failed Connect the server  我真是要被这破服务器整疯了，我花钱买罪受是吧？那行，差评拿好。", "timestamp_created": 1709930528, "timestamp_updated": 1709930528, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.52173912525177002", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "160130817", "author": {"steamid": "76561198824877683", "personaname": "EFRNAHADIFRTED", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/fanchenzi/", "num_games_owned": 386, "num_reviews": 22, "playtime_forever": 31583, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 33, "playtime_at_review": 8915, "last_played": 1787045625, "avatar": "